(7282684, 1134985, 2553, '<td valign="top">While I really enjoy this image, I don''t feel that it really conveys simplicity, as explained in the challenge decsription.  There is great complexity in the range of colors, textures and shapes!  I feel that perhaps you were going for simplicity in the form of a "simple life", but the description of the challenge..in part: "absence of complexity; plainness" doesn''t come across to me here.  Never-the-less, I do find it to be and engaging picture.</td>', 'While I really enjoy this image, I don''t feel that it really conveys simplicity, as explained in the challenge decsription.  There is great complexity in the range of colors, textures and shapes!  I feel that perhaps you were going for simplicity in the form of a "simple life", but the description of the challenge..in part: "absence of complexity; plainness" doesn''t come across to me here.  Never-the-less, I do find it to be and engaging picture.', '2014-11-09 10:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
