(7285274, 1134990, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m glad this showed up on the front page, because it reminded me to have another look at it. I was on vacation and viewed it on my brother-in-law''s monitor where I could clearly see the tabletop that the flower is resting on. Now that I''m home, and on my own calibrated monitor, the tabletop is solid black like it should be, and it looks wonderful! <br/> <br/>How are monitors still being shipped uncalibrated? Rawr!</td>', 'I''m glad this showed up on the front page, because it reminded me to have another look at it. I was on vacation and viewed it on my brother-in-law''s monitor where I could clearly see the tabletop that the flower is resting on. Now that I''m home, and on my own calibrated monitor, the tabletop is solid black like it should be, and it looks wonderful!  How are monitors still being shipped uncalibrated? Rawr!', '2014-11-14 11:27:18.000000', NULL, 0),
